				\begin{document}$${Q}_{NCQDs}={Q}_{Quinin} \times \frac{{F}_{NCQDs}}{{F}_{Quinin}} \times \frac{{A}_{st}}{{A}_{NCQDs}} \times \frac{{\eta }^{2} (NCQDs)}{ {\eta }^{2} (Quinin)}$$\end{document}QNCQDs=QQuinin×FNCQDsFQuinin×AstANCQDs×η2(NCQDs)η2(Quinin)

The regression equation was found to be Y = 0.0026x + 0.8307 using the Stern–Volmer equation, good linearity was established within the linear range of 50–700 ng mL−1, with a correlation coefficient is 0.9995 Fig. 4b.\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
