				\begin{document}$${\mathrm{F}}_{0}/\mathrm{F }= 1+\mathrm{Ksv }[\mathrm{Q}]$$\end{document}F0/F=1+Ksv[Q]where, F0 and F are the fluorescence efficiencies of the N@CQDs in the absence and presence of the MOD, respectively. [Q] is MOD concentration and Ksv is the Stern–Volmer constant.
